OL,3,GNEWSAFree car parking offered in run-up
OL,4,Ato Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FFree parking will be available in the
OL,7,Fcountdown to Christmas at council-owned
OL,8,Fcar parks in two boroughs of
OL,9,FNottinghamshire.
OL,11,FBassetlaw District Council has
OL,12,Fannounced parking will be free after
OL,13,F13:00 GMT each day in Retford and
OL,14,FWorksop, from Saturday 28 November to
OL,15,FMonday 4 January.
OL,17,FVisitors can also use Queen Street car
OL,18,Fpark in Worksop and West Street car
OL,19,Fpark in Retford free for one hour at
OL,20,Fany time of day, Monday to Saturday,
OL,21,Fthe authority said.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
